      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "lazy_unemployed_characterizations",
      "label": "Lazy/Unemployed Characterizations",
      "description": "A stereotype that associates overweight individuals with laziness, lack of ambition, and unemployment. This trope is often used to imply that the person’s physical condition is a result of poor choices or moral failure, rather than systemic or medical factors. The meme uses the person’s appearance to reinforce this negative assumption.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
