      "instance_name": "burden_on_society_claims",
      "label": "Burden on Society Claims",
      "description": "A common stereotype that portrays individuals who are perceived as dependent on public assistance or who have physical or mental conditions as a financial or social burden. This meme implies the person is receiving aid and is therefore a burden, which is a harmful and inaccurate generalization.",
